#: search2:search2_6C1E3712_DB41_4FC0_9741_04C66D419C6C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 81a23918197e5bdd8b94f6873fc39a29ae8e2003f11c50a758a15a28fae3db56
