msgid "⟪k:0⟫Are you seeing this... ⟪k:1⟫this same twisted nightmare as me...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Est-ce que vous le voyez... ⟪k:1⟫le même cauchemar malsain que moi... ?"

#: search2:search2_CFAAF7D4_A140_4C00_8D5E_8940E170B349
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 83ba44ac09d106169b2f3281a671bb3d3dad9f8f86b65bdda980fce5f73b3281
#. default-sha256: e1d68b0a7239d864bf6d70dbbd77da147c8459fdae417e891e846489b0969670
msgctxt "search2:search2_CFAAF7D4_A140_4C00_8D5E_8940E170B349"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫An image of her floating alone in a vast sea of blood flashes through my mind. ⟪k:1⟫That "
"vision kicks me into motion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Une image me traverse soudainement l’esprit : je la vois flotter, seule, dans un vaste océan "
"de sang. ⟪k:1⟫Cette vision me sort de ma torpeur."

#: search2:search2_33374CBE_24F0_4A09_9138_61414EFC8719
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 53db19a9d6d8ae1007631873900c5b05b014fc688fce8cefbd63639f285cc87f
#. default-sha256: 9e11b72c2e2281050ad10e63a4fe32a416f231123f3af9da0c07eebcfbfe5b65
msgctxt "search2:search2_33374CBE_24F0_4A09_9138_61414EFC8719"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I begin walking—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫or, more accurately, dragging my heavy feet forward. ⟪k:3⟫The "
"constant splashing of blood against my ankles grates at my already taut nerves."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je me mets à marcher—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ ou, plus précisément, je traîne vers l’avant mes pieds "
"pesants. ⟪k:3⟫Le sang éclabousse mes chevilles à intervalles réguliers, ce qui irrite encore plus "
"mes nerfs déjà soumis à rude épreuve."

#: search2:search2_A08671D4_1A35_4F99_BDAF_68240B8127C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 618fb75ae36489d9e2ce134edafd56efcd0bda5d4344dda68ef9c594c873e101
#. default-sha256: 9ffe2f8102ffe03e020789fcd54e7063895788c03d7fe5152c1c34513ad45003
msgctxt "search2:search2_A08671D4_1A35_4F99_BDAF_68240B8127C8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Morgana told me to find my way to her, and I can think of only one place she would be."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Morgana m’a dit de trouver le chemin menant vers elle, et il n’y a qu’un seul endroit qui me "
"paraît valable."

#: search2:search2_64DDCD57_C4DD_424C_96BE_39A865E23414
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1b3d51664e5e2976c0df9fa96026d20005f7fdc713193b055771785605360149
#. default-sha256: 7aafdcf0ab35d1ac57e432b741e9fba1acdf63bf75b5571df127e906e2ff2394
msgctxt "search2:search2_64DDCD57_C4DD_424C_96BE_39A865E23414"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She and Giselle must be there."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Giselle et elle doivent y être."

#: search2:search2_86126E8C_87B5_48EE_8C24_03057F9C1CC3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 98c0b7df39b765c3615bd7d837e3b3c636b29d8b87f51453b58e4e38593740f9
