#: search2:search2_96F73FBF_5BBB_4919_9815_440D63E09F0C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a2a10090e66468fcca284e0d26a37ff6c4f1e3733914903460ac3e7b09d10ca0
