msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Des chaînes noires luisantes condamnent la porte en métal."

#: search2:search2_CE0D7F82_7EA3_4CEF_8BCA_130F0610B5AD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e6c79d37ec74c2aa0745f425466a88a1c31e59d467781e2c3d7a22045e2d1965
